{"summary":"The objective is to empty the entire board except for a solitary peg!","description":"<b>Peg Solitaire has 6 popular boards and 80 different challenges!</b>\n\nThe objective of this traditional solitaire puzzle is to empty the entire board, except for a solitary peg in the green hole. A valid move is to jump a peg orthogonally over an adjacent peg into a hole two positions away. When a peg is jumped, it is removed from the board.\n\n<b>FEATURES:</b>\n- 6 popular boards\n- 80 challenges\n- unlimited undo\n- reset puzzle\n- google play achievements\n- smooth gameplay\n\n<i>Peg Solitaire (or Solo Noble) is a board game for one player involving movement of pegs on a board with holes. Some sets use marbles in a board with indentations. The game is known simply as Solitaire in the United Kingdom. It is also referred to as Brainvita (especially in India).</i>","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AgEG0YDH0IU?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4kS8Lg2ugSUICRGZplg9WJRUcVggHBZjMaU2GWhunlEbobp3odG8_UIa7awzaQCgKUBhdlfpT87lE8qvCxRDM34","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BYuQQGAMuVyms1soSI9MFlsE7xOIUQ1gx7HwOEirMV6g2XlCngGnDqL0D6arvdEfUh-z5RyaHjAu7e_4mtwWPw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Bg2YqMta4G8qGscEbMIXnq9JNqEL8UzppkiCA5cCR8GtA9r0OV7zkrxmRWeivRzNudhMBE1ePFol8Yc9SAesZuo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/W3_qT0pVylqXvGh7L5qH6GL8-U3iT3JM8VW6lgt6Yrj0ZNcn8a-vEdhyme53ywpXIwb-RfdPUG6ghCQodLGP3DE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/y6bKeoyhkQYRBhYUuklv_mmCcmm_vIKg3pqjAx4H7Z8DfDzUFXxtDGl1jjWySXcaW-VG2Q_IPcKk0zXz7nmd","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/b6j1KSzZ7UwQq9HdZkYYmcKGFzdzD5K0iYJ1aHaESE-R7rxIqfzblAhmuvze3HdnLEwxwJA4YfLunjIaUspKEg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RfaafacySJ0hM_AiaKuJdTCGAMvju3XsVU5AgO1xipTGmbBzuXMpwczKVkzyqZhJ7VqOtT9uFWsaMS-KVSaJ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rVbPWvuUTwmMbtRDWyi